data: {"id": "ba91e0d627d94024-thinking-layer-679", "run_id": "ba91e0d627d94024", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "由于 `kubectl get` 工具似乎不返回完整的事件详情，且 `ContainerCreating` 状态涵盖了多种可能（镜像拉取、卷挂载、Sandbox创建），根据常见性和诊断手册的针对性，我将优先排查最常见的 `ImagePullFailed` 和 `SandboxCreateFailed` 以及 `VolumeMountFailed`。\n\n但是，根据 Runbook 定义：\n- `pod-imagepull-failed.md`: STATUS=ImagePullBackOff/ErrImagePull\n- `pod-volume-mount-failed.md`: Pending/ContainerCreating (VolumeMountFailed)\n- `pod-sandbox-create-failed.md`: SandboxCreateFailed\n\n由于状态仅仅是 `ContainerCreating` 且没有更多事件证据，我无法在“定位阶段”100% 确定是哪一个。但在 Kubernetes 诊断中，`ContainerCreating` 是镜像拉取和沙箱", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788770258847}

