data: {"id": "ba91e0d627d94024-thinking-parallel_evidence-2252", "run_id": "ba91e0d627d94024", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 根因调查证据结论\n\n## 实体\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz`\n- **UID**: `86b6a1bf-eb40-431d-bfb5-00fe85ed2475`\n- **节点**: `node2`\n- **控制器**: `ReplicaSet/workload-5b5fc86c8c` -> `Deployment/workload`\n\n## 现状判定\n**未恢复**。Pod 持续处于 `Pending` 阶段，容器状态为 `Waiting` (Reason: `ContainerCreating`)，无重启历史。\n\n## 根因事实\n根据 `kubectl describe` 采集的 Events 事实，直接原因是 **VolumeMountFailed (ConfigMap 缺失)**：\n1.  **Events 原文**：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。\n2. ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788770659115, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

